#: lesson.yml:title
msgid "VisMetaDynamics"
msgstr "VisMetaDynamics"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"A graphical tool that allows you to visually inspect how the free energy "
"surface for a metadynamics simulation is affected by the choice of "
"hyperparameters"
msgstr ""
"Metadynamics シミュレーションにおいて、Hyperparameters "
"の選択が自由エネルギー面に及ぼす影響を視覚的に調べるためのグラフィカルツール"
